  "pitch": "A Simic ramp deck whose top end is a single card. Aurora Awakener reads 'reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal X permanent cards... Put any number of those permanent cards onto the battlefield', so on the turn it resolves it converts the colour count into a fistful of free permanents - and 20 of the 23 nonland cards in this list are permanents, so the reveal almost never burns a card. Getting there is the deck: Great Forest Druid and Bloom Tender accelerate, Prismatic Undercurrents adds a land drop every turn and fetches basics off the same colour count, and Puca's Eye cantrips into whichever colour the board is missing. Wildvine Pummeler and Prismabasher are the redundant top end that closes when Aurora Awakener does not appear, and Blossoming Defense and Spell Snare defend the one turn the whole plan hinges on.",
  "strategy_es": "aceleración/combo Vivid — montar siete manás y resolver Aurora Awakener",
  "identity_es": "Un mazo de aceleración Simic cuya gama alta es una sola carta. Aurora Awakener dice 'reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal X permanent cards... Put any number of those permanent cards onto the battlefield', así que el turno que resuelve convierte el recuento de colores en un puñado de permanentes gratis; y 20 de las 23 cartas no-tierra de esta lista son permanentes, así que la revelación casi nunca quema una carta. Llegar ahí es el mazo: Great Forest Druid y Bloom Tender aceleran, Prismatic Undercurrents añade una tierra jugada cada turno y busca básicas con ese mismo recuento de colores, y Puca's Eye cantrea hacia el color que le falte al tablero. Wildvine Pummeler y Prismabasher son la gama alta redundante que cierra cuando Aurora Awakener no aparece, y Blossoming Defense y Spell Snare defienden el único turno del que pende todo el plan.",
